摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"原生 DSH (DeepSeek Harness) 插件：PPT 演示文稿专家，内置 PPTD DSL 引擎、55173 所见即所得可视化编辑器、Python-PPTX 高保真离线编译内核与一键导出 PPTX。 | Native DSH plugin: PPT presentation expert with PPTD DSL engine, 55173 WYSIWYG editor, Python-PPTX offline compiler & 1-click PPTX export.","id":"gh:1334033861","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-np-ppt","slug":"z953218350/dsh-np-ppt","topics":["ai-ppt","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","ppt","pptx"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"原生 DSH (DeepSeek Harness) 插件：PPT 演示文稿专家，内置 PPTD DSL 引擎、55173 所见即所得可视化编辑器、Python-PPTX 高保真离线编译内核与一键导出 "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"PPTX。 | Native DSH plugin: PPT presentation expert with PPTD DSL engine, 55173 WYSIWYG editor, Pytho"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"n-PPTX offline compiler & 1-click PPTX export."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH NP-PPT 演示文稿专家插件 (dsh-np-ppt)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 🌐 **中文** · English\n>\n> DSH（DeepSeek Harness）原生专用的全功能 **PPT 演示文稿专家** 插件。内置 PPTD DSL 引擎、55173 所见即所得可"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"视化编辑器服务、Python-PPTX 高保真离线编译内核与一键导出 PPTX 功能。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## ✨ 核心特性"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"1. **🎭 9 大专业视觉风格体系**\n- 👔 商务管理风（墨绿+黄铜金）\n- 💻 深浅代码风（极客终端黑/蓝灰+亮绿）\n- 🚀 高能增长风（活力橙+稳重深蓝）\n- 🔮 炫光紫绿风（暗黑底色+电光紫"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"绿）\n- 📑 冷白调研风（瑞士极简白底+细黑线+红点缀）\n- 📱 轻拟态风（柔和浅灰白+微质感卡片+科技蓝）\n- 👑 黑金实验风（曜石黑+奢华哑光金）\n- 📊 色谱图表风（纯净白底+多维对比色谱）\n-"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" 📖 深蓝杂志风（深海蓝底+金句引述+画册感）"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"2. **🛠️ 模块化 PPTD 架构与标准 16:9 画布**\n- 采用清晰的 YAML 语法 DSL，解耦 OOXML 复杂逻辑，单个页面（`01_cover.page` ~ `XX_final."},{"id":"p6s2","text":"page`）完全独立自洽；\n- 自动添加淡入淡出（Fade）幻灯片平滑切换过渡。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"3. **🖥️ 55173 所见即所得可视化编辑器**\n- 内置轻量级本地 Web 编辑器（`http://127.0.0.1:55173/`）；\n- 支持多层嵌套富文本修改、自由拖拽对齐与实时渲染；"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"\n- **无缝集成**：点击右上角「导出」弹窗中的「下载」即可直接触发本地高保真 Python-PPTX 编译引擎下载文件；选择「图片」时保持原生图片切图下载。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"4. **⚡ 高保真离线原生编译内核（Python-PPTX）**\n- 基于 `RichTextHTMLParser` 状态机，完美支持无限层级嵌套 HTML 标签（`<span>`、`<strong"},{"id":"p8s2","text":">`、`<b>`、`<em>`、`<i>`、`<u>`、`<br/>`）与全格式颜色（`#HEX`、`rgb()`、`rgba()`、`$theme`）；\n- 微软雅黑字族锁定（`Microsoft "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"YaHei`）、DrawingML 渐变背景、`noAutofit` 文本框防缩放。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 🧩 环境要求"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| 依赖项 | 要求 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| **DSH (DeepSeek Harness)** | 已安装并能运行 `dsh` 命令 | 插件通过 `dsh plugin --profile web add` 挂载到 web profil"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"e，依赖 DSH 提供的 Cordis loader、systemPrompt 注入、Agent 工具等宿主能力 |\n| **Node.js** | 与你的 DSH 版本自带/要求的 Node 一致（"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"插件代码使用 ESM，需 Node 16+，推荐 18+） | 插件加载与 55173 编辑器服务由 Node.js 驱动；`lib/` 为预编译 ESM，无需自行构建 |\n| **pnpm** | "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"DSH profile 默认使用的 pnpm（随 DSH 自带） | 挂载安装走 `dsh plugin` → pnpm link；workspace 根目录需加 `-w` 标志 |\n| **Pyth"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"on** | 3.x（需可在命令行通过 `py -3` / `python3` / `python` 之一调用） | 高保真离线 PPTX 编译内核由 Python 驱动；插件会自动探测可用的 Pyt"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"hon 命令 |\n| **Python 依赖** | `pyyaml`、`python-pptx` | 首次运行编译器时会自动通过 pip 安装到临时目录（缺网/缺 pip 时可手动 `pip ins"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"tall pyyaml python-pptx`） |\n| **浏览器** | 推荐 Chrome / Edge 等支持 File System Access API 的现代桌面浏览器 | 55173"},{"id":"p11s8","text":" 编辑器使用 `window.showDirectoryPicker()` 等能力授权本地目录读写；不支持该 API 的浏览器会降级为只读上传模式 |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> 💡 仅做\"对话生成 + 命令行编译导出 PPTX\"时，浏览器不是必须；但要在 55173 可视化编辑器中拖拽对齐、实时渲染并一键下载，建议使用 Chrome/Edge 桌面版。"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## ✨ Key Features"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"1. **🎭 9 Preset Professional Visual Design Systems**\n- 👔 Business Management (Emerald + Brass Gold)\n"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"- 💻 Geek / Code Theme (Terminal Slate + Bright Green)\n- 🚀 High-Energy Growth (Vibrant Orange + Deep "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"Navy)\n- 🔮 Electric Violet (Cyber Dark + Neon Violet/Cyan)\n- 📑 Swiss Minimalist (Pure White + Fine Bl"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ack Line + Red Accent)\n- 📱 Neomorphic Tech (Soft Light Gray + Card Glass + Tech Blue)\n- 👑 Obsidian &"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" Gold (Matte Black + Luxury Satin Gold)\n- 📊 Metric Spectrum (Pure White + Multidimensional Spectrum)"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"\n- 📖 Deep Blue Pictorial (Deep Sea Blue + Quote Callouts + Editorial Feel)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"2. **🛠️ Modular PPTD DSL Architecture (16:9 Canvas)**\n- Clean YAML DSL abstracting OOXML, self-conta"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ined modular slides (`01_cover.page` ~ `XX_final.page`).\n- Automatic slide-level fade transitions."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"3. **🖥️ 55173 WYSIWYG Visual Editor**\n- Integrated lightweight local Web editor at `http://127.0.0.1"},{"id":"p16s2","text":":55173/`.\n- Multi-level nested rich-text editing, free drag-and-drop alignment, real-time rendering."},{"id":"p16s3","text":"\n- Seamless export interception: clicking \"Download\" inside the top-right \"Export\" dialog directly t"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"riggers the local high-fidelity Python-PPTX compiler; choosing \"Image\" keeps the native image-slice "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"he local high-fidelity Python-PPTX compiler; choosing \"Image\" keeps the native image-slice download."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"4. **⚡ High-Fidelity Python-PPTX Native Compiler**\n- Integrated `RichTextHTMLParser` supporting infi"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"nite nesting HTML tags (`<span>`, `<strong>`, `<b>`, `<em>`, `<i>`, `<u>`, `<br/>`) and CSS colors ("},{"id":"p17s3","text":"`#HEX`, `rgb()`, `rgba()`, `$theme`).\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 🧩 Requirements"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Dependency | Requirement | Notes |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| **DSH (DeepSeek Harness)** | Installed and the `dsh` command runnable | The plugin mounts via `dsh"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" plugin --profile web add` and relies on DSH's Cordis loader, systemPrompt injection, Agent tools, e"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"tc. |\n| **Node.js** | Match the Node bundled/required by your DSH version (plugin is ESM, needs Node"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" 16+, 18+ recommended) | Plugin loading and the 55173 editor service are Node-driven; `lib/` ships p"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"re-compiled ESM, no build needed |\n| **pnpm** | The pnpm used by the DSH profile (bundled with DSH) "},{"id":"p20s6","text":"| Mounting goes through `dsh plugin` → pnpm link; adding in a workspace root needs the `-w` flag |\n|"},{"id":"p20s7","text":" **Python** | 3.x (callable via one of `py -3` / `python3` / `python`) | The high-fidelity offline P"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"PTX compiler is Python-driven; the plugin auto-detects an available Python command |\n| **Python deps"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"** | `pyyaml`, `python-pptx` | Auto-installed via pip to a temp dir on first compiler run (offline /"},{"id":"p20s10","text":" no pip: manually `pip install pyyaml python-pptx`) |\n| **Browser** | Modern desktop browser with th"},{"id":"p20s11","text":"e File System Access API (Chrome / Edge recommended) | The 55173 editor uses `window.showDirectoryPi"},{"id":"p20s12","text":"cker()` for local folder read-write; browsers without it fall back to read-only upload |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> 💡 A browser is not required for \"conversation + CLI export\"; it's recommended only for the 55173 v"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"isual editor (drag-align, real-time render, 1-click download)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
